# Don't send any particular file by default.
*

# Explicitly whitelist files relevant to image creation.
!deployment
!merlin-server/build/distributions/*.tar
!merlin-worker/build/distributions/*.tar
!scheduler-server/build/distributions/*.tar

# merlin-worker/Dockerfile and merlin-server/Dockerfile COPY these directly (roadmap
# §8.2 narrowed their build context from the monorepo root to plandev/ itself, which is
# what makes this .dockerignore apply to their builds at all for the first time -- under
# the old `context: ..`, Docker looked for a .dockerignore at the monorepo root, found
# none, and this file was never consulted).
!docker/graalpy
!docker/graalpy/wheels
!docker/graalpy/wheels/spiceypy
!docker/graalpy/wheels/spiceypy/*.whl
!merlin-server/constraints-dsl-compiler

# DEV ONLY (docker-compose.dev.yml): a local pymerlin checkout staged into the build
# context by docker/graalpy/stage-local-pymerlin.sh, installed by install.dev.sh. Needs
# its own recursive entry for the same reason wheels/spiceypy above does -- `!docker/graalpy`
# alone does not re-include nested paths under an excluded root.
#
# This only makes the directory *sendable* when it exists; it is untracked and absent on a
# normal checkout, so production builds (which use install.sh and the pinned git ref) are
# unaffected either way.
!docker/graalpy/pymerlin-src
!docker/graalpy/pymerlin-src/**
